{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "4f737993-a41b-880a-8232-b7309f026ec8",
  "created_at": "2025-12-26T13:54:37-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Rosa Cordero",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T13:50:46-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T13:50:51-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, Denise. I need a replacement recycling bin. Mine's gone missing, I think the truck took it off with the rest, or the wind did."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T13:51:02-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I can help with that. Is this a bin that went missing on pickup day, or has it been gone a while?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T13:51:12-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Pickup day was Wednesday, and I put it out Tuesday night like always. Wednesday afternoon, no bin. I looked up and down the street, it's not there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T13:51:24-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. And what's the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T13:51:27-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "292 Coggeshall Avenue. Up the Hill, near the corner there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T13:51:32-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "292 Coggeshall. Got it. And your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T13:51:36-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Rosa Cordero. C-O-R-D-E-R-O."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T13:51:38-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks, Rosa. Are you the owner there or renting?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T13:51:42-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Renting. The landlord doesn't deal with the bins, that's all on me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T13:51:48-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine. Was it the standard blue bin, the one with the lid?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T13:51:54-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, the blue one with the lid. Sixty-some gallon, I guess. The regular size."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T13:52:00-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I'll put in the request for a replacement. Usually they get dropped off at the curb, so you won't need to come in. It can take a little while this time of year with the holiday week."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T13:52:16-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine. Is there somebody I can talk to about it, though? I'd like a supervisor to call me back, if that's possible."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T13:52:26-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, I can leave that for the supervisor. Can I ask what you'd like to go over with them? Just so I put it in the note."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T13:52:37-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Just the bin, and how long it'll be. I'd like to know a date, because I've got recycling piling up in the kitchen and no way to put it out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T13:52:50-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. I'll write that down. What number should they call?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T13:52:55-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0154. That's my cell."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T13:52:58-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-five-four. Right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T13:53:01-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T13:53:03-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. Is there a best time to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T13:53:07-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Afternoons are better. Not too late, though. I'm going to be tied up a bit, I just signed a permission slip for a field trip to a museum and I have to get it back to the school."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T13:53:23-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, afternoons it is. I'll note that. Sometimes supervisors are out for the holiday week, so it might be Monday before you hear back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T13:53:33-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Monday's fine. I just want to hear from somebody."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T13:53:37-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. In the meantime, if you've got extra recyclables, you can put them in a sturdy box or a bag and set it by the curb next to where the bin goes, though I'd mark it recycling so it's clear."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T13:53:54-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, a cardboard box, marked up. I can do that. Does it have to be a certain kind of bag?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T13:54:03-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Clear is best if you're going with a bag. Loose is even better, in a box."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T13:54:10-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright, box then. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T13:54:13-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Let me read back. Replacement blue recycling bin, 292 Coggeshall Avenue, Rosa Cordero, supervisor to call back at 401-555-0154 in the afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T13:54:23-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it exactly."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T13:54:25-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. Anything else I can do for you today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T13:54:29-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's all. Thanks, Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T13:54:32-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Rosa. Have a good rest of your Friday."
    }
  ],
